<title>USA: Scope Industries to tender 200,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Scope Industries to tender 200,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scope Industries said on Wednesday that it would file an offer to shareholders on July 11 to tender for cash 200,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Scope said it would pay between $48 and $52 per share for the stock and that the offer would expire on August 31.</p>
<p>If the company receives more than 200,000 shares, it will purchase from shareholders tendering at or below the selected purchase price, Scope added in a statement.</p>
<p>The offer to tender 200,000 shares represents 17 percent of the company's shares outstanding.</p>
